  _dimensions:
  - _id: 0
    title: PubSub
    lore: Messengers carry a promise to every listening lantern.
    motif: Six lanterns surround a central bell.
    inscriptionObject: bell
    concept: Publishers send messages without knowing their subscribers; listeners
      choose what to receive.
    practice: Broadcast a discovery once so independent listeners update themselves.
    watch: Release subscriptions when listeners leave to avoid stale reactions.
    hasKnowledge: 1
    surface:
      light: {r: 0.78039217, g: 0.8980392, b: 0.8666667, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.25882354, g: 0.42352942, b: 0.38039216, a: 1}
    navigation:
      light: {r: 0.3372549, g: 0.23137255, b: 0.29411766, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.41568628, g: 0.29411766, b: 0.36862746, a: 1}
  - _id: 1
    title: Processing
    lore: A request reaches the hand prepared to answer it.
    motif: One sealed request rests beside an open hand.
    inscriptionObject: request
    concept: A request reaches one handler and returns a result to its caller.
    practice: Use requests when a caller needs an answer or a clear failure.
    watch: Broadcast events do not promise a direct reply.
    hasKnowledge: 1
    surface:
      light: {r: 0.9411765, g: 0.8039216, b: 0.85490197, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.45490196, g: 0.2901961, b: 0.36078432, a: 1}
    navigation:
      light: {r: 0.20392157, g: 0.37254903, b: 0.3137255, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.27058825, g: 0.42352942, b: 0.3647059, a: 1}
  - _id: 2
    title: Databases
    lore: "Named records preserve the tower\u2019s memory."
    motif: Indexed shelves surround an engraved register.
    inscriptionObject: register
    concept: Stable record keys and query paths make related data easy to find.
    practice: Look up a record by key or index instead of scanning every entry.
    watch: Migrate old records when their stored shape changes.
    hasKnowledge: 1
    surface:
      light: {r: 0.8352941, g: 0.8666667, b: 0.9411765, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.3019608, g: 0.37254903, b: 0.5058824, a: 1}
    navigation:
      light: {r: 0.34901962, g: 0.28235295, b: 0.19607843, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.4392157, g: 0.3529412, b: 0.23529412, a: 1}
  - _id: 3
    title: MVVM
    lore: A reflection changes with the thing it represents.
    motif: Two facing mirrors repeat the same sigil.
    inscriptionObject: mirror
    concept: A ViewModel exposes state and actions; bindings update the View when
      state changes.
    practice: Keep presentation decisions in the ViewModel so views can share state.
    watch: Prevent feedback loops in two-way bindings.
    hasKnowledge: 1
    surface:
      light: {r: 0.8980392, g: 0.8392157, b: 0.9254902, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.39607844, g: 0.30980393, b: 0.4392157, a: 1}
    navigation:
      light: {r: 0.27058825, g: 0.33333334, b: 0.21568628, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.35686275, g: 0.41960785, b: 0.28235295, a: 1}
  - _id: 4
    title: PageFlows
    lore: Doorways remember where a traveler has been.
    motif: An arch connects the current chamber to remembered paths.
    inscriptionObject: arch
    concept: Screens, Popups, Tabs and companion pages have separate scopes and lifecycles.
    practice: Grant progress only after navigation reports an applied result.
    watch: An accepted request may still be canceled or fail.
    hasKnowledge: 1
    surface:
      light: {r: 0.8627451, g: 0.90588236, b: 0.78431374, a: 1}
      dark: {r: 0.34901962, g: 0.41960785, b: 0.27058825, a: 1}
    navigation:
      light: {r: 0.3254902, g: 0.24313726, b: 0.33333334, a: 1}
