  - _id: 5
    title: Persistence
    lore: What is remembered remains after the lantern goes dark.
    motif: A closed book keeps its luminous mark.
    inscriptionObject: book
    concept: Versioned saves keep progress separate from the current browsing session.
    practice: Save rune assignment and acquisition order, then verify both after
      loading.
    watch: Validate the saved version before restoring data.
